  <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">GUIDE TO OBTAINING YOUR FORM I-20</h1>
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">(Certificate of Eligibility for F-1 Student Status)</h2>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;"><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> To avoid delays in obtaining your I-20, please read the instructions carefully before completing the forms and submitting financial documents.</p>
  <p>Due to new government regulations in immigration policies, the information contained in this document is subject to change.</p>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Return all completed forms and documents in <span data-field="one_email">{{ one_email }}</span> to:</p>
  <p><strong>{{ contact_person_name }}</strong><br>
  <span data-field="contact_title">{{ contact_title }}</span><br>
  <span data-field="contact_office">{{ contact_office }}</span><br>
  <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span></p>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">For information about your admission, program of study, registration for courses, contact:</p>
  <p><span data-field="campus_address">{{ campus_address }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">This document includes:</h2>
