<div class="page">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">IF YOU ARE TRANSFERRING FROM ANOTHER U.S. INSTITUTION</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>INS Admissions Number</strong> (can be found on your form I-94 Departure Card): <span data-field="ins_admissions_number">{{ ins_admissions_number }}</span></li>
    <li><strong>SEVIS ID Number</strong> (can be found on the top right corner of your form I-20): <span data-field="sevis_id_number">{{ sevis_id_number }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Do you plan to travel outside the U.S. before school begins?</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Yes. If you plan to travel outside the U.S. before beginning classes, you must make careful arrangements with your advisor. You will be in violation of your F-1 status if you travel with your previous school's I-20. Provide us with acceptable financial support documents so that we can issue you a new I-20 for travel.</li>
    <li>No. Provide us with required financial support documents so that we can issue you a transfer I-20.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">OTHER REASONS FOR I-20 APPLICATION</h3>
  <p>Please check all that apply:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>I am a student with another status. Which one? <span data-field="other_status_1">{{ other_status_1 }}</span> I am planning to change my status to F-1. Please make an appointment with the advisor for instructions.</li>
    <li>I plan to travel outside the U.S. and need to renew my F-1 visa. I am going to <span data-field="travel_destination">{{ travel_destination }}</span> on <span data-field="travel_date">{{ travel_date }}</span>.</li>
    <li>I plan to travel outside the U.S. and need to apply for an F-1 visa because I entered the U.S. on another type of visa.</li>
    <li>I am applying for an extension of time to complete my program. My I-20 is expiring on <span data-field="i20_expiration_date">{{ i20_expiration_date }}</span>.</li>
    <li>I am applying for Reinstatement to F-1 student status.</li>
    <li>I am applying for F-2 status and/or visa for my spouse or children named below. My dependents are currently in the U.S.: <span data-field="dependents_in_us">{{ dependents_in_us }}</span> Yes No</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">Dependents Information</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Name (family, first, middle)</th>
