  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">If you are currently attending another school in the U.S., and are an F-1 Visa Holder, please refer to the "Transfer-In Information" and complete and submit the "Transfer-In Application" to schedule the release of your SEVIS record to <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>, which will issue your "Transfer-In Form I-20" as soon as this release date has passed and we have received all of your documentation.</p>
