  <p style="margin-top: 20px;"><strong>This affidavit must be sent with proof of the sponsor's annual income and bank statements. This affidavit will not be accepted unless it has been signed by the sponsor in the presence of a Notary Public and signed and sealed by the notary public. If this form has erasures or changes, the sponsor and the notary must initial each change.</strong></p>

