<div class="page">
  <h2>WHEN WILL YOU RECEIVE FORM I-20?</h2>
  <p>The Form I-20 lists your program start date; <span data-field="allowed_to_enter_us">{{ allowed_to_enter_us }}</span> <span data-field="days_before_start_date">{{ days_before_start_date }}</span>. F-1 student visas can be issued <span data-field="only_up_to_days_in_advance">{{ only_up_to_days_in_advance }}</span> of your program start date. The program start date is different from the date your classes begin because it allows time for ORIENTATION, MOVE-IN (if you will be living at EHS/St. George Residence) or with a relative, final program registration with an academic advisor, etc.</p>

  <p>To apply for your Form I-20, you must submit ALL of the following documents to <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>:</p>
  
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>Application for Form I-20 (page 6 of this packet)</li>
    <li>Reason for I-20 request, and Transfer Information, if applicable (page 6)</li>
    <li>Affidavit of Support (page 8)</li>
    <li>Affidavit of Sponsor of Free Room and Board, if applicable (page 9)</li>
    <li>Supporting financial documentation (see page 5 for guidelines)</li>
    <li>A copy of your (valid) passport and visa, if you currently have one.</li>
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Return all completed documents to:</p>
  <p>For information about your admission, program of study, registration for courses, contact:</p>
  <p><span data-field="contact_name">{{ contact_name }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span>, <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="mailing_address_line1">{{ mailing_address_line1 }}</span></p>
  <p>Attn: Global Studies, Rm. 220</p>
  <p><span data-field="mailing_city_state_zip">{{ mailing_city_state_zip }}</span></p>
</div>

